+# Glossary
+
+- **Support case** — A customer issue associated with one account and handled by an optional support-user assignee.
+- **Case resolution** — The short, customer-visible comment recorded when a support case is closed.
+- **Case assignee** — The support user responsible for handling a particular case; this is distinct from support users assigned to the related account.
diff --git a/docs/adr/0001-case-resolution-comments.md b/docs/adr/0001-case-resolution-comments.md
